  "description": "Add a romantic touch to your next embroidery project with this Heart Arrow Embroidery Design! ❤️🏹 Featuring a stylish arrow surrounded by beautiful heart-shaped elements, this design creates a unique love-themed look that is perfect for Valentine’s Day, couples, anniversaries, and romantic gifts.\nIts clean and eye-catching design works beautifully on T-shirts, hoodies, sweatshirts, jackets, tote bags, pillows, blankets, caps, and personalized gifts.\n✨ Perfect For:\nValentine’s Day • Love & Romance Projects • Couples • Anniversary Gifts • Romantic Gifts • T-Shirts • Hoodies • Sweatshirts • Jackets • Tote Bags • Pillows • Blankets • Personalized Gifts\nCompatible with Brother, Baby Lock, Janome, Bernina, Husqvarna Viking, Singer, and most embroidery machines.\nThis is a digital embroidery file only. No physical product will be shipped.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a romantic touch to your next embroidery project with this Heart Arrow Embroidery Design! ❤️🏹 Featuring a stylish arrow surrounded by beautiful heart-shaped elements, this design creates a unique love-themed look that is perfect for Valentine’s Day, couples, anniversaries, and romantic gifts.</p>\n<p>Its clean and eye-catching design works beautifully on T-shirts, hoodies, sweatshirts, jackets, tote bags, pillows, blankets, caps, and personalized gifts.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect For:<br>\nValentine’s Day • Love &amp; Romance Projects • Couples • Anniversary Gifts • Romantic Gifts • T-Shirts • Hoodies • Sweatshirts • Jackets • Tote Bags • Pillows • Blankets • Personalized Gifts</p>\n<p>Compatible with Brother, Baby Lock, Janome, Bernina, Husqvarna Viking, Singer, and most embroidery machines.<br>\nThis is a digital embroidery file only. No physical product will be shipped.</p>",
